    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/eb579dc7e6318cd7f1ee58c70e4bcb63.poster.avif?t=1751319944\" width=800 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/eb579dc7e6318cd7f1ee58c70e4bcb63.webm?t=1751319944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/c9ff9441489134966aaeb9a7e5e61219.avif?t=1751319944\" width=534 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the misty sanctuary of San Andr\u00e9s de Teixido, you awaken to whispers of an ancient cult and their unholy rite. As the veil between worlds begins to fray, explore, solve puzzles, and escape - before you become part of the ritual.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/4afa513d86772c4bbcaac461c01af17c.webp?t=1751319944\" width=222 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a mist-shrouded village of Galicia, ancient shadows stir as whispers of A Irmandade da Compa\u00f1a echo once more. Long thought lost to time, the cult of the dead has resurfaced, gathering in the sanctuary of San Andr\u00e9s de Teixido to summon something evil. Their ritual nears completion, and with it, the boundary between the living and the dead begins to fray.\u00a0The ritual remains incomplete, for only a witch can seal the final act of summoning. Until today, they had none. But that is about to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in darkness, the air thick with an eerie presence. Something stirs - something that should have remained buried. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/279657e7dd76675c23ef9314954a34f2.webp?t=1751319944\" width=223 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hellkind is a short and immersive experience inspired by the folklore and atmosphere of Galicia and Spain - blends exploration, light puzzle solving, all set against a backdrop of ancient religious rituals and forbidden knowledge. As players navigate the eerie sanctuary and its shadowed corners, they will feel the weight of claustrophobic tension, with unseen horrors lurking just beyond the veil of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its forgotten cults, spectral processions, and the ever-present temptation of religion, the game weaves elements of supernatural horror and mystery into a chilling experience. Every step feels like a step toward salvation, pushing them closer to unraveling the cult\u2019s dark intentions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/eb579dc7e6318cd7f1ee58c70e4bcb63.poster.avif?t=1751319944\" width=800 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/eb579dc7e6318cd7f1ee58c70e4bcb63.webm?t=1751319944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/c9ff9441489134966aaeb9a7e5e61219.avif?t=1751319944\" width=534 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the misty sanctuary of San Andr\u00e9s de Teixido, you awaken to whispers of an ancient cult and their unholy rite. As the veil between worlds begins to fray, explore, solve puzzles, and escape - before you become part of the ritual.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/4afa513d86772c4bbcaac461c01af17c.webp?t=1751319944\" width=222 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a mist-shrouded village of Galicia, ancient shadows stir as whispers of A Irmandade da Compa\u00f1a echo once more. Long thought lost to time, the cult of the dead has resurfaced, gathering in the sanctuary of San Andr\u00e9s de Teixido to summon something evil. Their ritual nears completion, and with it, the boundary between the living and the dead begins to fray.\u00a0The ritual remains incomplete, for only a witch can seal the final act of summoning. Until today, they had none. But that is about to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in darkness, the air thick with an eerie presence. Something stirs - something that should have remained buried. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583310/extras/279657e7dd76675c23ef9314954a34f2.webp?t=1751319944\" width=223 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hellkind is a short and immersive experience inspired by the folklore and atmosphere of Galicia and Spain - blends exploration, light puzzle solving, all set against a backdrop of ancient religious rituals and forbidden knowledge. As players navigate the eerie sanctuary and its shadowed corners, they will feel the weight of claustrophobic tension, with unseen horrors lurking just beyond the veil of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its forgotten cults, spectral processions, and the ever-present temptation of religion, the game weaves elements of supernatural horror and mystery into a chilling experience. Every step feels like a step toward salvation, pushing them closer to unraveling the cult\u2019s dark intentions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
